<![CDATA[<div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">This is a project task transition alert.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Preceding Task related to dependent Task(</font><a href="{!pse__Project_Task__c.Link}">{!pse__Project_Task__c.Name}</a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">)</span><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;has been completed. Please review the project task schedule per the link below and take appropriate next steps on your assigned Task(s).</span></font></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!pse__Project_Task__c.NSP_Project_Number__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!pse__Project_Task__c.NSP_Account__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!pse__Project_Task__c.NSP_AIMS_Account__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Click the following link to review the project record:&nbsp;</font><font style="">{!pse__Project_Task__c.NSP_Project_Link__c}</font></font></p></div>]]></td>
